OL,3,GNEWSAThe designers finding beauty in
OL,4,Anature's darker side
OL,5,
OL,6,FDesigners Alistair McAuley and Paul
OL,7,FSimmons have been telling stories
OL,8,Fthrough their subversive designs for
OL,9,Fdecades.
OL,11,FFinding beauty in nature's darker side
OL,12,Fand providing a social commentary on
OL,13,Flife in the modern world, for them the
OL,14,Fmost interesting stories are often
OL,15,Ffound in the details others overlook.
OL,17,FThe duo behind the Timorous Beasties
OL,18,Fdesign studio first met while studying
OL,19,Fprinted textiles at Glasgow School of
OL,20,FArt in 1984.
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
